what: one walk over the tree; a tell embeds f(a) with a single
  flatMap and continues; a forwarded Async op re-enters the loop as
  foldWith does. No semantics change: same order, same effects.

prediction (before the number): okayCollectionForeach_elem_runForeach
  162 -> 100-130 (the uncons program per element -- a Pure, an Either,
  a Bind, a call -- is replaced by one Bind). The chunkNative channel
  row 18.9 moves little: its per-element work is inside the chunk, not
  in the walk. Disqualifier: < 10% on the elem lane, which would say
  the cost is f(a)'s own Async.Run through the handler, not the walk.
